WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.390
The Timeline, along the bottom, plays changes back over time, locked to the tempo.

2
00:00:05.847 --> 00:00:08.095
Click the plus button to make a timeline.

3
00:00:08.095 --> 00:00:11.605
It is sixteen bars long, at one hundred twenty beats per minute.

4
00:00:12.058 --> 00:00:14.501
Click the ruler to move the playhead.

5
00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:15.030
Bar one.

6
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.969
Every knob has a small diamond above it.

7
00:00:17.969 --> 00:00:21.517
Click Z Push's diamond to set a keyframe at the playhead.

8
00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:24.314
Move to bar three, and turn Z Push up.

9
00:00:24.314 --> 00:00:28.329
Once a parameter has a lane, every change is keyed automatically.

10
00:00:28.786 --> 00:00:32.501
The lane below draws the curve, in the same numbers as the knob.

11
00:00:32.951 --> 00:00:33.632
Press Play.

12
00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:38.152
The depth rises from bar one to bar three, holds, and the timeline loops.

13
00:00:40.413 --> 00:00:42.638
Key as many parameters as you like.

14
00:00:42.638 --> 00:00:45.753
Next: scenes, which capture a whole look at once.
